  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Look, this is a leather belt.' Holding up the strap at his station, Fedya shows off the leather belt. Then Senya replies.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Зачем он тебе на кухне?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why do you have it in the kitchen?' Senya teases him by asking why he has a belt on a kitchen prep table.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Я буду его есть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am going to eat it.' Fedya declares stubbornly that he is about to cook and eat it.",
