   "t": "Это кожаный ремень?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Is it a leather belt?' Senya double-checks that it is genuine, tough leather.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Он очень длинный.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is very long.' He points out that the belt is very long too.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Я повар.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am a chef.' Fedya puffs out his chest and reminds Senya that he is a professional chef.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Я приготовлю и съем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will cook it and eat it.' He vows to prepare the leather like a proper dish and eat every bite. Senya answers straight away.",
